<title>Iran and the regional confrontation: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/iran/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-iran-2026-11-03T01:42:30.386Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 03 Nov 2026 01:42:30 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Iran announced it would reopen the Strait of Hormuz within two days as part of a U.S. deal, while the United States struck Iran's Qeshm Island, according to reports. Tehran continued negotiations with Qatari mediators and U.S. officials, with President Trump saying a deal could happen and urging faster ceasefire talks. Israeli officials urged new strikes on Iran, and Gulf Arab states expressed concern over the war cloud. The conflict remains active with both sides exchanging threats and limited strikes, and 123 battle-related deaths occurred in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/02/world/middleeast/iran-deal-strait-of-hormuz.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/2/war-tariffs-and-china-what-the-us-midterms-mean-for-the-asia-pacific?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/business/2026/nov/02/oil-price-falls-amid-hope-of-a-breakthrough-to-end-iran-war&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxPWXRvLUpqbi1FNFBLbTk4Y0lENWhacExyTXdZOGNvNENlYVd1WWdUWGpLdFBRQzM3S25GNUtNTUI2SEF3QVdrZFh1ZC11eDhUNEZfWVdNemhDazlUa0oxVEY2TXk5NmlGcVRNRFFMSUZwdlZYdVNTM3R0aVdYbFZVNmRCRzRZQ0FNMmFWMVBodFlOZzNhdUg0SEJacUNHTW_SAaQBQVVfeXFMT21lMjVQYV9jeGVYWTg0Rk5nWW5pQzg3MFhSS0NVRXUtQlBuNHcxUk5EQVVNR0FNY0NKalRuaFFrckpaYWhvY2s1NW5SeVZWa2ZVbk1XbVk2QUxhV1J6UmV6OU1JOEg3bV9JNkF6bnFzc0JlZVNBZDlsbTJoOHRnbDVWbUtsREpQQ0J0TW9JUGRfYUhzOHpHd3pLc1R3SF9naVNvZUg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxNUW9iaUN1YmNnZlZ0a05YVklpS2I1dFp2UHR0VzNRaXRubGN6ZWczLWNqdlhaTENzcUtZYjQ4OG5Ca19nVmZjZTVEYlNGTTU4QXpZYVVXOXhnMTIzYXJBeWY5ZXdTREpkN1ZCNmNzd0d4eThoOTZmVUtFSEQ1NHg0b2VQU08xaHh5R01MUWhNN